    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just tell me to keep pushing, to find meaning in the chaos. but what if there isn't any? what if the only real way to actually stop the cycle is to just... stop? to not be part of it anymore? it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just let the whole thing go.",
